request.description:
GET /api/users/{id}

Mengambil detail user berdasarkan ID.
Auth: USER:DETAILS (Superadmin)

GET /api/users/by-username/{username}

Mengambil detail user berdasarkan username (profil sendiri).
Auth: Authenticated (hanya bisa akses profil sendiri)

DELETE /api/users/{id}

Menghapus user.
Auth: USER:DELETE (Superadmin)

DELETE /api/roles/{id}

Hapus role.
Auth: ROLE:DELETE (Superadmin)

GET /api/loan-applications/{id}

Get detail pengajuan.
Auth: LOAN:DETAILS (All Roles)

GET /api/plafonds/{id}

Detail plafond.
Auth: PLAFOND:DETAILS (Superadmin)

DELETE /api/plafonds/{id}

Hapus (Soft Delete) plafond.
Auth: PLAFOND:DELETE (Superadmin)

